WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.710
<i>What's with this restaurant?</i>

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:00.450
<i>It's as if... as if...
this were a pirate ship!</i>

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:03.850
We've got trouble!
Pirate Krieg's underling...

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.660
This is a restaurant, right?

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:13.160
Sir, do you have money for that?

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:14.500
Would a bullet do?

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.360
So you don't have money, right?

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.000
Eat it.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.680
I found a good cook!

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.410
This is a good opportunity.

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.180
Damn geezer!

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.620
Leave this place with them!

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.610
You're no longer needed
at this restaurant!

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:45.680
<i>"The Strongest Pirate Fleet.
Commodore Don Krieg."</i>

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:52.370
Hey, you damn geezer!
I'm the Sous Chef here.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.800
What do you mean you
no longer need me?!

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:57.040
You often get into
trouble with customers.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:00.370
You flare your nostrils
the second you see a girl.

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.640
You can't even cook a decent meal,

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:05.310
so you're deadweight
to this restaurant.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:06.980
That's what I said.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:08.970
Say that again...

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:15.160
Also, the other cooks
steer clear of you...

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.530
So go be a pirate or whatever,

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:21.050
and just leave this
restaurant already!

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.870
Say what?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:30.000
If I keep quiet, you just shoot your
mouth off, huh? You damn geezer!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.110
The rest I could overlook,

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:35.110
but I'm not just gonna
let you trash my cooking!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:39.180
No matter what you say,
I'll stay here as a cook!

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.750
And that's final!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:44.690
Just what's the meaning of you
grabbing the owner by the collar?

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.680
You idiot!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:51.350
Damn you...

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.660
Quit screwing around...

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:58.370
No matter how hard you
try to kick me out,

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:01.970
I'll continue to work
here as a cook...

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.870
...until you die!

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:07.640
I won't die!
I'll live 100 more years!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.710
That geezer is never
short of words...

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:12.650
All right, you have permission!
Now you can become a pirate.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.650
No way!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.650
Now... Sorry about that.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.820
I'd like to make up for it by serving
you fruit macedonia, my princess.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.160
Wow, thank you! You're so kind.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:24.830
Any time...

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.160
And no apology to us?!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.660
I'm gonna sue you,
you stupid love cook!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:34.000
I'm serving you tea, aren't I?
Thank me for that, long-nose.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.670
Huh? You wanna fight?
I won't go easy on you.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.010
Beat him up, Zoro!

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.670
Do it yourself.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.010
Stop! Please don't
fight because of me.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.010
Yes, I'll stop.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:46.080
Who said it was because of you?!

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.180
--By the way, you know...
--Yes?

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.650
The food you have
here is delicious...

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.850
but it seems a little
expensive for me...

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.360
Of course, it'll be free.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.020
Thank you!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.030
Yours are not free.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.030
Wha...

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:01.460
You're too predictable.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.970
What are you sitting around for?!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.970
When customers sit down,
bring them moist hand-towels!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.130
Yes sir.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:22.450
Well... with this
and that going on,

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:25.490
four days have passed...

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:27.990
When can we leave here?

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.660
Who knows...

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:33.330
Is he really going to work here
as a chore boy for a year?

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:36.930
What's the problem? The food
is free and it's comfortable here.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:39.030
<i>For you it is.</i>

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.340
Hey, Luffy!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:43.340
Hmm?

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:47.010
What's going on?!
Let's leave here soon!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:52.010
Wait a little longer.
I'll try talking to Owner again.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:54.350
I'm begging you!

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.300
Hey, what's the matter?

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:42.500
An hourglass...
on each side of the skull...

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.000
to show the threat to enemies...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.500
That flag is... that flag is...

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:52.670
There's no mistake... it belongs
to the ruler of the East Blue...

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.170
Don Krieg!!

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.960
Why... why are
the Krieg Pirates here?!

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:15.760
You see it, Patty?!
They actually came!

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.730
You're gonna get
rid of them, right?!

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.630
I-isn't it a mistake?!

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.640
This is the Don of a pirate fleet with
a 5000-pirate force we're talking about!

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:25.640
Why would he come all the way here
to get revenge just for one of his men?!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:29.140
It's no mistake! He's really here!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:32.650
Hey, this is not good!
Shouldn't we just get out of here?!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:35.480
What a huge galleon!

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:44.330
<i>What a huge ship!</i>

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.160
I wonder if Ghin came back
to repay you for your kindness.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:49.660
I don't think so...

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.660
But it seems strange...

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:01.610
H-hey...

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:03.600
Wh-what the...

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.790
Their ship sure is beat up...

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:17.620
It doesn't seem like they
were attacked by cannons...

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:20.490
But then, it's hard to think
that damage is manmade.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.830
Did they come across
a tornado or something?

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.790
Here he comes...

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:26.290
S-sorry... Can I have
some water and food?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:30.960
We have money...
tons of money...

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.970
I don't even remember
the last time I ate.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:43.810
Please... give me some
water and food...

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:47.980
Wh-what's that?!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.320
He shows neither dignity nor force.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:55.320
<i>Is he really that Don Krieg,
Commodore of the grand pirate fleet?</i>

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.990
So he's hungry...

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.190
C-Captain!

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:07.830
Don Krieg!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.670
P-please! Help our captain!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.010
He's really about to starve!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:19.840
He hasn't eaten anything for days!
He'll die if he doesn't eat!

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:29.520
This is good! It's a riot to see

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:33.690
the famous arch rogue
Don Krieg like this...

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.700
We have money this time.
We're customers!

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:41.030
Don't be ridiculous!
Hey, contact the Navy right away.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.040
What?

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.710
He's at his weakest right now.
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:49.480
There's no need to feed him anything.
Keep him under arrest.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:52.710
He's right! We don't know what
he'll do once his energy's back.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.380
He's done bad things.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:59.390
He deserved to starve because
of everything he's done!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:03.320
Once he's back to normal, I bet he'll
attack this restaurant straight away.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:06.660
There's no need to give him
even a glass of water.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:10.150
I won't do anything...

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.000
I won't do anything...

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:18.340
Once I eat,
I promise I'll leave quietly.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:22.680
So please... help... me...

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.010
Don Krieg, please stop!

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:29.180
Please stop begging!
It's not something you should do!

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:32.020
Please don't do
something so disgraceful!

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:38.860
I promise... Please...
I'll take leftovers or anything...

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.360
Anything...

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.190
Don...

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.710
Ha! Are you trying
to gain our sympathy?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.700
Hey, out of my way, Patty.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:04.750
Oh boy...

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:08.420
<i>S... Sanji-san!</i>

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:14.420
Here, Ghin. Let him eat it.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.660
<i>Sanji-san...</i>

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.340
Thank you!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.120
Hey, Sanji!
Take that food away now!

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:42.120
Do you realize what
kind of man he is?!

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:45.460
He's the man who's called
the East Blue Ruler,

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:47.690
the foul player Krieg!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:52.870
It started in a prison.
He pretended to be a marine soldier

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:57.040
and took over a Navy ship by killing
a senior officer on the ship.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.700
That's how he declared himself a pirate.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:03.980
He sometimes raised the Navy flag
and entered into harbors

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.310
in order to attack the towns
and passenger ships.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:09.320
He also raised a white flag
and then attacked enemy ships...

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:14.150
He did anything to continue winning.
That's how he got to where he is now!

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.660
Huh, so he plays dirty.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.660
His real strength is
overwhelming as well.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:25.000
Leaving after eating?
That's not possible with him!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:30.160
Letting such a wicked fiend die
without help is for society's sake!

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:18.140
What?!

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.990
S... Sanji!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:33.830
Th... this isn't what
we agreed, Don Krieg!

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:38.000
I brought you here under the condition
that you wouldn't touch this restaurant!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:42.170
And that man saved our lives...

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:48.500
Yeah, that was delicious.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:52.180
I feel alive again.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:12.410
H-hey... Wh-what the hell
is going on in there?

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.970
We'll see when we go in there.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.980
What?! A-are you serious?!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.640
Oh? Are you scared?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.810
Wha... Don't be silly!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.970
Hmph!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.820
This is strange...

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:28.310
There's almost no sign
of anyone on that ship...

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:53.340
This is a good restaurant.
I'll take this ship.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.690
So... that's what you want...

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:01.620
Ow, ow, ow...

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:17.300
My ship became a wreck,
so I wanted a new one.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:21.480
You'll get off this ship after you
take care of what I tell you to do.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.980
Wh-what?!

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:27.140
Don Krieg... This isn't
what you promised.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:33.750
There're about 100 of my underlings
still alive on my ship.

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:37.320
They're weak with hunger
and severe injuries.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:43.330
First, prepare 100 meals
and water for them.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:47.000
There're some who've
already starved to death.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.490
W-water...

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:55.510
Bring them over immediately!

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:58.550
Are you telling us
to revive pirates

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.680
that are gonna attack this ship?!

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:02.620
We refuse!

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:06.290
Refuse? Don't get the wrong idea.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:11.290
I'm not placing an order.
I'm giving you orders.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:18.630
It doesn't matter who you are...
don't defy me!!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.810
<i>Sanji-san...</i>

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:27.810
Hmm?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:32.810
<i>Sanji-san, I'm sorry...
I didn't mean this to happen...</i>

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:37.150
You son of a bitch!
Look what you've done!!

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:58.000
Hey Sanji! Where're you going?!

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:05.950
To the kitchen.
I have to prepare 100 more meals.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.610
<i>--Sanji-san!
--Sanji?!</i>

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:10.950
--What?!
--What?!

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:14.510
Right. That's how it should be.

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:27.070
Are you Krieg's spy, Sanji?!

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:29.300
We can't let you go in the kitchen!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.470
We're fed up with your crazy behavior!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.710
Go ahead...

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:40.700
If you want to stop me, go ahead!

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:45.320
I know...

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:49.650
He's an incorrigible rogue...
I know that much...

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:57.660
But that doesn't matter to me.
That doesn't matter!

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:02.270
What happens after we feed them...
It's too much of a bother to think about it.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.440
I'm a cook. No more. No less.

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:11.340
If there's someone who's hungry,
I'll feed him. That's all.

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:15.680
It's all right for a cook
to be that way, don't you think?

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:23.960
Patty!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:27.030
Hey, someone keep him restrained!

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:33.300
Sanji, you sometimes feed customers
I drive away at the back door, don't you?

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:39.310
I'm not gonna say who's right,
but this time, it's your mistake.

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:41.980
I'm not going to let you
do what you want any longer.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.310
I'll protect this restaurant.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:46.050
Fortunately, we have
only one enemy to fight.

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:50.480
Even if it's Don Krieg,
what can he do against us?

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:55.720
This is a sea restaurant where
pirates come and go every day.

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:59.330
We're fully prepared to serve
any kind of customer!

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:00.330
That's...

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.830
<i>Are you full now, Krieg-san?</i>

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.000
After the main course, how about...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:10.840
a piece of iron dessert?!

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:16.170
Meat Ball of Doom!!

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:33.190
Don!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:42.540
I might've broken the doors.
Owner's gonna yell at me again.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.870
Well, you did it to
protect the restaurant.

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.110
It's a small price to pay.

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:50.540
What're you gonna do about
those in Krieg's ship?

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.880
Who knows...

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:55.370
Maybe we'll spread butter on
the ship and stir-fry it...

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:06.990
It'll taste good, right?
You lame cook!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:11.160
How dare you serve such
a nasty dessert!

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.500
This is the lousiest restaurant!

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.330
You're damn annoying!!

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:28.350
From all over his body...

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:29.680
Bullets...

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.700
Don't defy me!

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:50.700
I'm the strongest!

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.370
Steel arms more powerful
than anyone's...

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:56.380
A wootz steel made body
that is harder than anyone's...

00:21:56.380 --> 00:22:01.050
And a diamond fist that
can destroy anything!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.650
I have all sorts of built
in weapons throughout my body...

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:07.820
The 50-ship large fleet
and 5000 pirate force!

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:11.660
I've won all battles in the past!

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:17.000
I am the man fit to be called Don!

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.830
Out of my way, kid!

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:24.100
When I tell you to prepare food,

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:27.340
all you have to do is
obediently follow orders!

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:30.000
Don't defy me!

00:22:35.350 --> 00:22:37.620
There's probably enough
for 100 meals in this.

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:39.850
Bring it to your ship right away.

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:41.350
--Owner Zeff!
--Owner Zeff!

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:45.350
What's with that pops?
I could've gotten hurt!

00:22:48.190 --> 00:22:51.190
Z... Zeff?

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:24:02.560
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
